0">ever </span><span begin="00:22.690" end="00:23.290">find </span><span begin="00:23.290" end="00:23.410">him </span><span begin="00:23.410" end="00:23.890">being </span><span begin="00:23.890" end="00:25.420">unfaithful</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.660" end="00:29.920"><span begin="00:25.660" end="00:25.960">you </span><span begin="00:25.960" end="00:26.260">will </span><span begin="00:26.260" end="00:27.010">find </span><span begin="00:27.010" end="00:27.220">him' </span><span begin="00:27.220" end="00:27.490">you'll </span><span begin="00:27.490" end="00:28.240">find </span><span begin="00:28.240" end="00:28.510">him </span><span begin="00:28.510" end="00:28.870">next </span><span begin="00:28.870" end="00:28.960">to </span><span begin="00:28.960" end="00:29.920">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.600" end="00:35.560"><span begin="00:31.600" end="00:31.900">you </span><span begin="00:31.900" end="00:32.170">won't </span><span begin="00:32.170" end="00:32.710">find </span><span begin="00:32.710" end="00:32.830">him </span><span begin="00:32.830" end="00:33.310">trying </span><span begin="00:33.310" end="00:33.370">to </span><span begin="00:33.370" end="00:33.940">chase </span><span begin="00:33.940" end="00:34.060">the </span><span begin="00:34.060" end="00:35.560">devil</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.400" end="00:40.600"><span begin="00:36.400" end="00:36.700">for </span><span begin="00:36.700" end="00:37.180">money' </span><span begin="00:37.180" end="00:37.690">fame' </span><span begin="00:37.690" end="00:37.870">for </span><span begin="00:37.870" end="00:38.650">power' </span><span begin="00:38.650" end="00:39.070">out </span><span begin="00:39.070" end="00:39.130">of </span><span begin="00:39.130" end="00:40.600">grief</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.770" end="00:45.640"><span begin="00:41.770" end="00:41.980">you </span><span begin="00:41.980" end="00:42.400">won't </span><span begin="00:42.400" end="00:42.910">ever </span><span begin="00:42.910" end="00:43.480">find </span><span begin="00:43.480" end="00:43.600">him </span><span begin="00:43.600" end="00:44.050">where </span><span begin="00:44.050" end="00:44.170">the </span><span begin="00:44.170" end="00:44.560">rest </span><span begin="00:44.560" end="00:45.640">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.880" end="00:50.380"><span begin="00:45.880" end="00:46.210">you </span><span begin="00:46.210" end="00:46.480">will </span><span begin="00:46.480" end="00:47.230">find </span><span begin="00:47.230" end="00:47.440">him' </span><span begin="00:47.440" end="00:47.710">you'll </span><span begin="00:47.710" end="00:48.520">find </span><span begin="00:48.520" end="00:48.730">him </span><span begin="00:48.730" end="00:49.060">next </span><span begin="00:49.060" end="00:49.180">to </span><span begin="00:49.180" end="00:50.380">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.860" end="00:55.960"><span begin="00:50.860" end="00:51.280">next </span><span begin="00:51.280" end="00:51.430">to </span><span begin="00:51.430" end="00:53.890">me </span><span begin="00:53.890" end="00:55.960">ooooh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.990" end="01:00.730"><span begin="00:55.990" end="00:56.350">next </span><span begin="00:56.350" end="00:56.620">to </span><span begin="00:56.620" end="00:58.930">me </span><span begin="00:58.930" end="01:00.730">ooooh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.000" end="01:05.470"><span begin="01:01.000" end="01:01.390">next </span><span begin="01:01.390" end="01:01.540">to </span><span begin="01:01.540" end="01:03.970">me </span><span begin="01:03.970" end="01:05.470">ooooh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.470" end="01:11.200"><span begin="01:05.470" end="01:05.560">you </span><span begin="01:05.560" end="01:06.730">will </span><span begin="01:06.730" end="01:07.450">find </span><span begin="01:07.450" end="01:07.690">him' </span><span begin="01:07.690" end="01:07.960">you'll </span><span begin="01:07